Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/locate-anything-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for nvidia/LocateAnything-3B visual grounding (CUDA build)
 locate-anything detects, grounds, points at and reads text in images
 with nvidia/LocateAnything-3B (MoonViT + Qwen2.5 with Parallel Box
 Decoding), locally via candle. The model weights (about 7.6 GB) are
 downloaded from Hugging Face on first use into ~/.cache/locate-anything-
 rs, or taken from --model DIR. This build is linked against CUDA. Needs
 an NVIDIA GPU with compute capability 8.0+ (Ampere or newer) for the
 bf16 path. libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package) satisfies
 the runtime link; it does not by itself guarantee driver/toolkit
 compatibility.
